                <p>
                    <ref target="frus1931-41v02#pg_768">
                        <hi rendition="#italic">Ibid.</hi>, p. 768</ref>.</p>
            </note>
            <note corresp="#d486-f4" n="4" xml:id="d486-f4-content">
                <p>Telegram No. 784 of the same date, not printed; it was repeated to the Ambassador
                    in China as telegram No. 274.</p>
